nd": 212.28, "text": " The model.", "tokens": [51328, 440, 2316, 13, 51412], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1555227601384542, "compression_ratio": 1.7826086956521738, "no_speech_prob": 0.008208544924855232}, {"id": 43, "seek": 19132, "start": 212.28, "end": 216.24, "text": " The motion is one-dimensional along a straight line.", "tokens": [51412, 440, 5394, 307, 472, 12, 18759, 2051, 257, 2997, 1622, 13, 51610], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1555227601384542, "compression_ratio": 1.7826086956521738, "no_speech_prob": 0.008208544924855232}, {"id": 44, "seek": 19132, "start": 216.24, "end": 219.48, "text": " The graph is made of straight line position segments,", "tokens": [51610, 440, 4295, 307, 1027, 295, 2997, 1622, 2535, 19904, 11, 51772], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1555227601384542, "compression_ratio": 1.7826086956521738, "no_speech_prob": 0.008208544924855232}, {"id": 45, "seek": 21948, "start": 219.48, "end": 223.23999999999998, "text": " so the velocity is constant within each time interval.", "tokens": [50364, 370, 264, 9269, 307, 5754, 1951, 1184, 565, 15035, 13, 50552], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1319347277079543, "compression_ratio": 1.969325153374233, "no_speech_prob": 0.0009130547405220568}, {"id": 46, "seek": 21948, "start": 223.23999999999998, "end": 227.39999999999998, "text": " A positive slope represents motion in the positive direction.", "tokens": [50552, 316, 3353, 13525, 8855, 5394, 294, 264, 3353, 3513, 13, 50760], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1319347277079543, "compression_ratio": 1.969325153374233, "no_speech_prob": 0.0009130547405220568}, {"id": 47, "seek": 21948, "start": 227.39999999999998, "end": 235.23999999999998, "text": " A zero slope represents zero velocity, and a negative slope represents motion in the negative direction.", "tokens": [50760, 316, 4018, 13525, 8855, 4018, 9269, 11, 293, 257, 3671, 13525, 8855, 5394, 294, 264, 3671, 3513, 13, 51152], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1319347277079543, "compression_ratio": 1.969325153374233, "no_speech_prob": 0.0009130547405220568}, {"id": 48, "seek": 21948, "start": 235.23999999999998, "end": 236.72, "text": " The math.", "tokens": [51152, 440, 5221, 13, 51226], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1319347277079543, "compression_ratio": 1.969325153374233, "no_speech_prob": 0.0009130547405220568}, {"id": 49, "seek": 21948, "start": 236.72, "end": 238.35999999999999, "text": " Part A.", "tokens": [51226, 4100, 316, 13, 51308], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1319347277079543, "compression_ratio": 1.969325153374233, "no_speech_prob": 0.0009130547405220568}, {"id": 50, "seek": 21948, "start": 238.35999999999999, "end": 243.88, "text": " The velocity during each interval is the slope of the position versus time graph.", "tokens": [51308, 440, 9269, 1830, 1184, 15035, 307, 264, 13525, 295, 264, 2535, 5717, 565, 4295, 13, 51584], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1319347277079543, "compression_ratio": 1.969325153374233, "no_speech_prob": 0.0009130547405220568}, {"id": 51, "seek": 24388, "start": 243.88, "end": 250.44, "text": " During the first interval, the position changes from 0.0 meters to 0.5 meters,", "tokens": [50364, 6842, 264, 700, 15035, 11, 264, 2535, 2962, 490, 1958, 13, 15, 8146, 281, 1958, 13, 20, 8146, 11, 50692], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1114993973782188, "compression_ratio": 1.8676470588235294, "no_speech_prob": 0.014455826953053474}, {"id": 52, "seek": 24388, "start": 250.44, "end": 255.72, "text": " while the time changes from 0.0 seconds to 0.5 seconds,", "tokens": [50692, 1339, 264, 565, 2962, 490, 1958, 13, 15, 3949, 281, 1958, 13, 20, 3949, 11, 50956], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1114993973782188, "compression_ratio": 1.8676470588235294, "no_speech_prob": 0.014455826953053474}, {"id": 53, "seek": 24388, "start": 255.72, "end": 267.08, "text": " which gives v equals 0.5 meters minus 0.0 meters divided by 0.5 seconds minus 0.0 seconds", "tokens": 