y", "tokens": [51536, 440, 2535, 295, 257, 12359, 2684, 2051, 264, 2031, 12, 24633, 307, 2212, 538, 51768], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08897090465464491, "compression_ratio": 1.735, "no_speech_prob": 0.0023999600671231747}, {"id": 76, "seek": 37492, "start": 374.92, "end": 380.2, "text": " x of t equals 3.0 meters per second times t,", "tokens": [50364, 2031, 295, 256, 6915, 805, 13, 15, 8146, 680, 1150, 1413, 256, 11, 50628], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09852359233758388, "compression_ratio": 1.7177914110429449, "no_speech_prob": 0.007178441155701876}, {"id": 77, "seek": 37492, "start": 380.2, "end": 385.64000000000004, "text": " plus 0.5 meters per second cubed times t cubed.", "tokens": [50628, 1804, 1958, 13, 20, 8146, 680, 1150, 36510, 1413, 256, 36510, 13, 50900], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09852359233758388, "compression_ratio": 1.7177914110429449, "no_speech_prob": 0.007178441155701876}, {"id": 78, "seek": 37492, "start": 385.64000000000004, "end": 390.44, "text": " Part A. Using the definition of instantaneous velocity,", "tokens": [50900, 4100, 316, 13, 11142, 264, 7123, 295, 45596, 9269, 11, 51140], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09852359233758388, "compression_ratio": 1.7177914110429449, "no_speech_prob": 0.007178441155701876}, {"id": 79, "seek": 37492, "start": 390.44, "end": 395.96000000000004, "text": " find the instantaneous velocity at t equals 2.0 seconds.", "tokens": [51140, 915, 264, 45596, 9269, 412, 256, 6915, 568, 13, 15, 3949, 13, 51416], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09852359233758388, "compression_ratio": 1.7177914110429449, "no_speech_prob": 0.007178441155701876}, {"id": 80, "seek": 37492, "start": 395.96000000000004, "end": 403.0, "text": " Part B. Calculate the average velocity between t sub 1 equals 1.0 seconds,", "tokens": [51416, 4100, 363, 13, 3511, 2444, 473, 264, 4274, 9269, 1296, 256, 1422, 502, 6915, 502, 13, 15, 3949, 11, 51768], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09852359233758388, "compression_ratio": 1.7177914110429449, "no_speech_prob": 0.007178441155701876}, {"id": 81, "seek": 40300, "start": 403.0, "end": 407.08, "text": " and t sub 2 equals 3.0 seconds.", "tokens": [50364, 293, 256, 1422, 568, 6915, 805, 13, 15, 3949, 13, 50568], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08649935119453518, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 0.0003229873545933515}, {"id": 82, "seek": 40300, "start": 407.08, "end": 411.32, "text": " The model. The particle moves along the x-axis,", "tokens": [50568, 440, 2316, 13, 440, 12359, 6067, 2051, 264, 2031, 12, 24633, 11, 50780], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08649935119453518, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 0.0003229873545933515}, {"id": 83, "seek": 40300, "start": 411.32, "end": 413.96, "text": " so its motion is one-dimensional.", "tokens": [50780, 370, 1080, 5394, 307, 472, 12, 18759, 13, 50912], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08649935119453518, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 0.0003229873545933515}, {"id": 84, "seek": 40300, "start": 413.96, "end": 418.76, "text": " Instantaneous velocity describes the rate at which the position changes", "tokens": [50912, 38707, 15447, 9269, 15626, 264, 3314, 412, 597, 264, 2535, 2962, 51152], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08649935119453518, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 0.0003229873545933515}, {"id": 85, "seek": 40300, "start": 418.76, "end": 423.32, "text": " at a single instant, while average velocity describes the net change", "tokens": [51152, 412, 257, 2167, 9836, 11, 1339, 4274, 9269, 15626, 264, 2533, 1319, 51380], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08649935119453518, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 0.0003229873545933515}, {"id": 86, "seek": 40300, "start": 423.32, "end": 426.44, "text": " in position over a finite time interval.", "tokens": [51380, 294, 2535, 670, 257, 19362, 565, 15035, 13, 51536], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08649935119453518, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 0.0003229873545933515}, {"id": 87, "seek": 40300, "start": 426.44, "end": 430.28, "text": " Because the position function is a polynomial in time,", "tokens": [51536, 1436, 264, 2535, 2445, 307, 257, 26110, 294, 565, 11, 51728], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08649935119453518, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 0.0003229873545933515}, {"id": 88, "seek": 43028, "start": 430.28, "end": 436.52, "text": " the instantaneous velocity can be found by differentiating the position function directly.", "tokens": [50364, 264, 45596, 9269, 393, 312, 1352, 538, 27372, 990, 264, 2535, 2445, 3838, 13, 50676], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0952983538309733, "compression_ratio": 1.7833333333333334, "no_speech_prob": 0.000666155363433063}, {"id": 89, "seek": 43028, "start": 436.52, "end": 438.91999999999996, "text": " The math. Part A.", "tokens": [50676, 440, 5221, 13, 4100, 316, 13, 50796], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0952983538309733, "compression_ratio": 1.7833333333333334, "no_speech_prob": 0.000666155363433063}, {"id": 90, "seek": 43028, "start": 438.91999999999996, "end": 444.67999999999995, "text": " The instantaneous velocity is the derivative of the position function with respect to time,", "tokens": [50796, 440, 45596, 9269, 307, 264, 13760, 295, 264, 2535, 2445, 365, 3104, 281, 565, 11, 51084], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0952983538309733, "compression_ratio": 1.7833333333333334, "no_speech_prob": 0.000666155363433063}, {"id": 91, "seek": 43028, "start": 444.67999999999995, "end": 448.91999999999996, "text": " which gives v of t equals dx over dt,", "tokens": [51084, 597, 2709, 371, 295, 256, 6915, 30017, 670, 36423, 11, 51296], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0952983538309733, "compression_ratio": 1.7833333333333334, "no_speech_prob": 0.000666155363433063}, {"id": 92, "seek": 43028, "start": 448.91999999999996, "end": 455.64, "text": " which equals the derivative with respect to time of 3.0 meters per second times t,", "tokens": [51296, 597, 6915, 264, 13760, 365, 3104, 281, 565, 295, 805, 13, 15, 8146, 680, 1150, 1413, 256, 11, 51632], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0952983538309733, "compression_ratio": 1.7833333333333334, "no_speech_prob": 0.000666155363433063}, {"id": 93, "seek": 45564, "start": 455.64, "end": 460.59999999999997, "text": " plus 0.5 meters per second cubed times t cubed,", "tokens": [50364, 1804, 1958, 13, 20, 8146, 680, 1150, 36510, 1413, 256, 36510, 11, 50612], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08727228045463561, "compression_ratio": 1.802547770700637, "no_speech_prob": 0.0011741584166884422}, {"id": 94, "seek": 45564, "start": 460.59999999999997, "end": 463.64, "text": " equals 3.0 meters per second,", "tokens": [50612, 6915, 805, 13, 15, 8146, 680, 1150, 11, 50764], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08727228045463561, "compression_ratio": 1.802547770700637, "no_speech_prob": 0.0011741584166884422}, {"id": 95, "seek": 45564, "start": 463.64, "end": 468.68, "text": " plus 1.5 meters per second cubed, t squared.", "tokens": [50764, 1804, 502, 13, 20, 8146, 680, 1150, 36510, 11, 256, 8889, 13, 51016], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08727228045463561, "compression_ratio": 1.802547770700637, "no_speech_prob": 0.0011741584166884422}, {"id": 96, "seek": 45564, "start": 468.68, "end": 477.0, "text": " The instantaneous velocity at t equals 2.0 seconds is found by evaluating this function at that time,", "tokens": [51016, 440, 45596, 9269, 412, 256, 6915, 568, 13, 15, 3949, 307, 1352, 538, 27479, 341, 2445, 412, 300, 565, 11, 51432], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08727228045463561, "compression_ratio": 1.802547770700637, "no_speech_prob": 0.0011741584166884422}, {"id": 97, "seek": 45564, "start": 477.0, "end": 483.0, "text": " which gives v of 2.0 seconds equals 3.0 meters per second,", "tokens": [51432, 597, 2709, 371, 295, 568, 13, 15, 3949, 6915, 805, 13, 15, 8146, 680, 1150, 11, 51732], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08727228045463561, "compression_ratio": 1.802547770700637, "no_speech_prob": 0.0011741584166884422}, {"id": 98, "seek": 48300, "start": 483.0, "end": 489.16, "text": " plus 1.5 meters per second cubed times 2.0 seconds squared,", "tokens": [50364, 1804, 502, 13, 20, 8146, 680, 1150, 36510, 1413, 568, 13, 15, 3949, 8889, 11, 50672], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0845041104725429, "compression_ratio": 1.7261904761904763, "no_speech_prob": 0.004051246680319309}, {"id": 99, "seek": 48300, "start": 489.16, "end": 494.2, "text": " which equals 9.0 meters per second. Part B.", "tokens": [50672, 597, 6915, 1722, 13, 15, 8146, 680, 1150, 13, 4100, 363, 13, 50924], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0845041104725429, "compression_ratio": 1.7261904761904763, "no_speech_prob": 0.004051246680319309}, {"id": 100, "seek": 48300, "start": 494.2, "end": 499.32, "text": " The average velocity between t sub 1 equals 1.0 seconds,", "tokens": [50924, 440, 4274, 9269, 1296, 256, 1422, 502, 6915, 502, 13, 15, 3949, 11, 51180], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0845041104725429, "compression_ratio": 1.7261904761904763, "no_speech_prob": 0.004051246680319309}, {"id": 101, "seek": 48300, "start": 499.32, "end": 505.56, "text": " and t sub 2 equals 3.0 seconds requires the position at each end point,", "tokens": [51180, 293, 256, 1422, 568, 6915, 805, 13, 15, 3949, 7029, 264, 2535, 412, 1184, 917, 935, 11, 51492], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0845041104725429, "compression_ratio": 1.7261904761904763, "no_speech_prob": 0.004051246680319309}, {"id": 102, "seek": 48300, "start": 505.56, "end": 511.72, "text": " which gives x of 1.0 seconds equals 3.0 meters per second", "tokens": [51492, 597, 2709, 2031, 295, 502, 13, 15, 3949, 6915, 805, 13, 15, 8146, 680, 1150, 51800], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.0845041104725429, "compression_ratio": 1.7261904761904